        ),
        # Click-outside-to-close, half one of two.  The drawers window covers the
        # screen but its input mask deliberately leaves the middle click-THROUGH,
        # so a click "outside the launcher" is delivered to the app underneath and
        # the shell never sees it.  Upstream does not need to see it: the
        # hyprland_focus_grab_v1 protocol takes that click instead and fires
        # HyprlandFocusGrab.onCleared, which is the ONLY code path in the whole
        # shell that closes a drawer by clicking away.  KWin does not implement the
        # protocol - the shell log says so verbatim, twice per run - so nothing
        # ever closed.  Reported as "its just locked".
        # Taking the whole surface while a dismissible drawer is up is exactly what
        # a focus grab does, so this is the same bargain, not a new one: while the
        # launcher is open, clicks and scrolls do not reach the app below.
        #
        # DO NOT write this as `focusGrab.active`.  That reads back FALSE FOREVER on
        # KWin: the QML binding assigns to it, but HyprlandFocusGrab drops the write
        # when the protocol is missing, so the property never changes and nothing
        # that depends on it ever re-evaluates.  Measured, not guessed - an earlier
        # version of this patch used focusGrab.active and the mask never went null.
        # (Same trap explains why upstream's own `if (focusGrab.active) return 0`
        # in dragMaskPadding above is dead code here.)  So the condition is copied
        # out of focusGrab.active and evaluated ourselves.
        (
            "    mask: hasFullscreen ? emptyRegion : regions",
            "    // [LUMINOS-KWIN] No hyprland_focus_grab_v1 on KWin, so an outside click\n"
            "    // has to actually REACH us before Interactions.qml can act on it.  A null\n"
            "    // mask means the whole surface is ours, which is exactly what the focus\n"
            "    // grab would have done.  Mirrors focusGrab.active, plus detached popouts\n"
            "    // (volume/brightness/notifications), whose only other way out is the\n"
            "    // second focus grab in modules/bar/popouts/Wrapper.qml.\n"
            "    readonly property bool luminosGrab: {\n"
